{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910723001:1":{"text":"Why is the scenery the same again? We've been heading in the same direction this whole time. Just how big is this building?","source_cn":"怎么又是相同的景色？我们明明一直在往同一个方向走，这座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3EE9B51E77F6FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910723002:1":{"text":"... I've left marks on the ground. Keep going.","source_cn":"……我在地上留了刻痕，继续向前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582E75BE81646162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1910723003:1":{"text":"Moments later...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF845E0F952CAFB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Moments later...","female":"Moments later...","variant_male_record_index":"253549","variant_female_record_index":"253550","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910723004:1":{"text":"The marks on the ground haven't changed. We're going in circles.","source_cn":"地上的刻痕没变，我们是在原地打转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93E83ECB63336A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910723005:1":{"text":"Why is this happening? Could it be the Graveborn? But he's not even here...","source_cn":"这是为什么……难道是那个亡